{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>南韓演員孫藝珍10月18日分享日本橫濱旅行照，從遊樂設施、海邊散步到逛雜貨店，畫面充滿難得的放鬆感。她以舒服自在的休閒私服入鏡，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭，也讓留言區出現「明星私下穿什麼，究竟該不該被評論」的兩派討論。</p><p>孫藝珍近況如何？</p><p>孫藝珍在Instagram曬出多張橫濱照片，僅寫下「祝大家有個美好的週日」，沒有多做旅程說明。照片中，她有時坐上遊樂設施高舉雙手、笑得相當開心；有時則戴著太陽眼鏡，在海邊、摩天輪與雜貨店前留下自然身影。</p><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616400637890560467128.jpeg/tfk7FjL-0Q2s9jGZiRxjL6si4gFwsmN95eF5QuXheUI\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><p>更多孫藝珍日本橫濱出遊照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616278432649216807935.jpeg/oDs9_e-FvQ0LNVVVx9rRnaHkQe0rZWaEC0xxrwtMca8\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，網猜測旁邊應是老公玄彬和兒子。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189624088474161152947253.jpeg/sdzXJexHUCEap8jYW-byIM94xLgXx2oU3wwgm98MIJs\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，網猜測旁邊應是老公玄彬和兒子。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616280878059520074961.jpeg/uzkArLm7k9EdrmUlSShB4uZtWy83Rl9E8Lvu5vC77uY\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616283101171712096154.jpeg/XK23B4UsRQHkfeF4-I-t3ojvVMmirx7pvUYddb1GHXU\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616285311700992182960.jpeg/h4kQHtSA1s_viqtHTux5WilxJD4y7JY-Rk9_lkZPf5Y\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinfoot_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292146210476032450172.jpeg/a14ueP3qfKCELWIeEKo9SbiHiY9AL1WSWhqrM1oaqzM\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinfoot_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292148626526208531682.jpeg/0wHMPG2gTDsCR64zItgvc689H8URDVGeiMLKpojCyqY\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189618904180199424154893.jpeg/VyMzwpgfii4Yc_1ciA2b0xW62Y3YHO4XYQn6h2EJ-oc\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131985518867910656384279.jpeg/0AB1QanWKfi4zTS0W8eO8X_oiXNGqf7xZsDgfGbA4Hw\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍依舊具有時尚感。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187757869945196544186539.jpeg/Bx-vOtcL7wpUBgP8IM6--VDko9mK8Ixr_4bFyP-Gxcg\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍依舊具有時尚感。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230712/755859393597149184268951.jpeg/IgkFHhUYMVA7FqcgYHPjHO0wRNeVO15JifTidYn04nU\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>這趟旅行的服裝以舒適為主，包括黑色上衣搭牛仔褲，以及寬鬆運動衫、長褲與球鞋等基本單品。有韓媒指出，她部分造型也加入日本品牌的層次單品，並非刻意走紅毯式的精緻路線，而是明顯以方便出遊為優先。</p><p>不過照片曝光後，仍有少數留言批評她「今天穿搭又失手」、「為什麼這樣穿出門」，甚至出現帶有外貌攻擊意味的說法。另一派網友則替她抱不平，認為「私服怎麼穿關你什麼事」，更直言放假出遊本來就不必隨時維持華麗造型。韓媒也將這波反應形容為，原本輕鬆的日常分享，被過度延伸成穿搭與外貌評分。</p><p>孫藝珍2022年與玄彬結婚，同年迎來兒子。她近來因Netflix韓劇《挑情醜聞》回歸螢幕，行程與私下近況都受到關注。這次橫濱照真正留下的重點，原本只是她脫離工作、自在享受週末的幾個片段。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：玄彬孫藝珍結婚4年罕放閃親密攬實　3歲仔暴風式長高完美遺傳爸爸（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693411672854528760529.jpeg/_qGbmWKeAUQ_-oQRP2TlNngM_quwWicRUIsUqlCLFKo\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：玄彬孫藝珍結婚4年罕放閃親密攬實　3歲仔暴風式長高完美遺傳爸爸（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玄彬與老婆孫藝珍結婚4年，一直恩愛如初。近日孫藝珍在社交平台上分享旅行靚相，更激罕放閃曬出與老公玄彬甜蜜攬實合照，甜蜜氛圍閃盲一眾網民！（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693409034506240304769.jpeg/blQbXbgRAty4UYZ3iIv3wuxT6bf8n6pMI1rsVSNa7FU\"/><figcaption>玄彬與老婆孫藝珍結婚4年，一直恩愛如初。近日孫藝珍在社交平台上分享旅行靚相，更激罕放閃曬出與老公玄彬甜蜜攬實合照，甜蜜氛圍閃盲一眾網民！（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍曬出兩人甜蜜攬實合照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693403866992640369725.jpeg/SILSCyNf6THZcTSi6uf-LEHup5r5ikQgcrCuVnKwrlY\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍曬出兩人甜蜜攬實合照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小鳥依人。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693416542703616627459.jpeg/2RUA85ghNJ4Wu9-CdjW3HB37N83GGY-b5_Zeuef2Xrk\"/><figcaption>小鳥依人。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好sweet~（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693414286036992782195.jpeg/83T-8Gm7O77TqBqEU2I659T-eNaxOZZc-jjoWfo46Fk\"/><figcaption>好sweet~（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"年僅3歲的「小甜豆」已明顯抽高不少。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693406685564928293084.jpeg/bT2ROzAQE2AUIbzC3fQee63tHDVHkb0D4H3HHOB9xxw\"/><figcaption>年僅3歲的「小甜豆」已明顯抽高不少。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玄彬憑《韓國製造》勇奪百想視帝，更藉機向老婆孫藝珍表白。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145693932026335232172048.jpeg/UKivl4UwTcsxZ8RRnuXuOosvQFl1PosGXxGdK18RnSs\"/><figcaption>玄彬憑《韓國製造》勇奪百想視帝，更藉機向老婆孫藝珍表白。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好冧！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145694101300056064354709.jpeg/2upLS7akhDAxrqkGu0kqyj1OBChhbRgILNxhKyzcYSs\"/><figcaption>好冧！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>孫藝真 IG 曬大口吃炸物掀論戰！遭網友嫌：「這吃相顏值也救不了！」</p><p>【本文獲「JUKSY街星」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:22:53.072448+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1255,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:52.229140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:52.229140+00:00","content_hash":"5845ef2934250c3e704efd589b9511b603b3dd01fc7062826ca6d5491090a687","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}